    <bpmn:process id="W_W4915" name="W4915. PPE Standards, Role Hazard Assessment &amp; Issuance Matrix" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy set (W4913); new role/equipment/process; HSE review (VS-24); incident
Frequency: Per hazard-assessment cycle + on change
Volume: ~8–10 PPE categories (hard hat, safety shoes/steel-toe, hi-vis, eye/face, hearing, respiratory)
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Manager
Participants: HSE (VS-24), HR (VS-19), Store Ops (VS-07), DC Ops (VS-04), Occupational Health (VS-83), Procurement (VS-03/VS-34)
Source: workflow W4915 — PPE Standards, Role Hazard Assessment &amp; Issuance Matrix</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4915_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4915_Lane1" name="HSE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4915_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4915_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4915_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4915_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4915_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4915_Start3" name="Strategy set (W4913); new role/equipment/process; HSE review (VS-24); incident">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4915_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4915_Task4" name="Conduct role-based hazard assessments (links VS-24): per role/work-zone…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Conduct role-based hazard assessments (links VS-24): per role/work-zone (lumber-yard forklift, paint/chemical handling, DC manual handling, cutting station, electrical work, working-at-height, driving), identify required PPE per DOLE-OSH standards, manufacturer specs, and the PPE hazard hierarchy
Responsible (R): HSE / Operations / Occupational Health
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4915_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4915_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4915_Task5" name="Build the PPE issuance matrix: role → required-PPE list → standard/spec →…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Build the PPE issuance matrix: role → required-PPE list → standard/spec → issue-quantity → replacement-cycle → fit-test requirement (e.g., respiratory fit-test, harness inspection); align to the uniform standard (W4914) and DOLE compliance (W4930)
Responsible (R): HSE / Program Manager
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4915_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4915_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4915_Task6" name="Govern PPE standards, certification &amp; change: source certified PPE (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern PPE standards, certification &amp; change: source certified PPE (links VS-117/VS-31 quality), update the matrix on role/equipment/process/incident change, and verify via the issuance &amp; audit cycle (W4922/W4930)
Responsible (R): HSE / Procurement / Quality
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4915_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4915_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4915_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4915_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4915_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-737 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Strategy, Policy &amp; Sourcing (PA-169.1).) | - CTL-737: role-based hazard assessment complete; PPE matrix per DOLE; certified PPE (VS-117); fit-test tracked; audited (W4930)
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4915_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4915_Annotation8" targetRef="W4915_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
