    <bpmn:process id="W_W4916" name="W4916. Uniform Allowance, Replenishment Cycle &amp; Policy Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy set (W4913); annual policy review; total-rewards review (VS-102)
Frequency: Annual + on policy change
Volume: ~6,932 employees + contingent × allowance/replenishment policy
Owner: Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Manager / HR / Total Rewards (VS-102) / Finance
Participants: HR (VS-19/VS-102), Finance (VS-17.4), Store Ops (VS-07), Payroll (VS-19.2)
Source: workflow W4916 — Uniform Allowance, Replenishment Cycle &amp; Policy Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4916_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4916_Lane1" name="Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4916_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4916_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4916_Lane2" name="Payroll">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4916_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4916_Lane3" name="HRSS">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4916_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4916_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4916_Start5" name="Strategy set (W4913); annual policy review; total-rewards review (VS-102)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4916_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4916_Task6" name="Design the allowance/replenishment policy: own-issue vs cash-allowance vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Design the allowance/replenishment policy: own-issue vs cash-allowance vs hybrid per role, the onboarding kit quantity, the replenishment cycle (e.g., annual set + wear-out replacement), PPE replacement-on-condition, and the rules for damage/loss/theft (chargeable vs company-borne); align to total rewards (VS-102)
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Total Rewards / Finance
Accountable (A): CHRO / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4916_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4916_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4916_Task7" name="Configure the allowance in payroll/HRIS (VS-19.2/VS-29): allowance amount per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Configure the allowance in payroll/HRIS (VS-19.2/VS-29): allowance amount per role, taxable vs non-taxable treatment (BIR/DOLE), replenishment triggers, and the reconciliation between allowance paid and uniforms issued (avoid double-dip); manage the employee self-service request flow (VS-103)
Responsible (R): Payroll / HRSS / Finance
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4916_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4916_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4916_Task8" name="Communicate &amp; govern: publish the policy to employees/managers (links VS-103)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Communicate &amp; govern: publish the policy to employees/managers (links VS-103), enforce the replenishment cycle, track allowance vs actual-issue variance (W4929), and review annually with total rewards &amp; finance
Responsible (R): HRSS / Program Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4916_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4916_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4916_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4916_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4916_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-737 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Strategy, Policy &amp; Sourcing (PA-169.1).) | - CTL-737: role-based allowance policy; allowance vs issue reconciled; taxable treatment correct; cycle enforced
Owner: Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Manager / HR / Total Rewards (VS-102) / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
