    <bpmn:process id="W_W4917" name="W4917. Uniform / Workwear / PPE Vendor Selection &amp; Contracting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sourcing event; contract expiry; quality/cost issue; expansion
Frequency: Per sourcing event + multi-year contract
Volume: ~2–5 uniform/workwear/PPE suppliers + laundering vendor group-wide
Owner: Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Manager / Procurement (VS-03/VS-34) / Legal (VS-100.3)
Participants: Suppliers, HR (VS-19), HSE (VS-24), Finance (VS-17), TPRM (VS-161), Quality (VS-31)
Source: workflow W4917 — Uniform / Workwear / PPE Vendor Selection &amp; Contracting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4917_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4917_Lane1" name="Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4917_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4917_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4917_Lane2" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4917_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4917_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4917_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4917_Start4" name="Sourcing event; contract expiry; quality/cost issue; expansion">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4917_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4917_Task5" name="Define vendor requirements: garment quality/durability, brand-compliance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Define vendor requirements: garment quality/durability, brand-compliance (W4914), PPE certification (W4915/VS-117), sizing range (W4918), lead time, minimum-order, embroidery/branding capability, ethical/labor compliance (VS-131), and sustainability (W4934); plus laundering capability/capacity (W4924) if vendor-laundry
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Procurement / HSE / Quality
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4917_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4917_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4917_Task6" name="Run sourcing &amp; contract: RFP, evaluate (quality/cost/lead-time/ethical…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Run sourcing &amp; contract: RFP, evaluate (quality/cost/lead-time/ethical VS-131/TPRM VS-161/sustainability), negotiate (price/SLA/lead-time/warranty/returns/exits), and contract via Legal with TPRM, ethical-sourcing, and RA 10173 (sizing data) provisions; structure as frame agreement + call-off
Responsible (R): Procurement / Legal / TPRM / Program Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO / Legal
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4917_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4917_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4917_Task7" name="Onboard: integrate to HRIS/ESS ordering (VS-103/VS-29), the supplier portal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Onboard: integrate to HRIS/ESS ordering (VS-103/VS-29), the supplier portal (VS-03.4), set quality-inspection on receipt (VS-31), and manage performance (W4931) and re-compete at term
Responsible (R): Procurement / Program Manager / HRSS / Quality
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per partner + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4917_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4917_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4917_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4917_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
