    <bpmn:process id="W_W4918" name="W4918. Sizing, Fit &amp; Body-Measurement Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New-hire onboarding (VS-121/VS-19); vendor change (W4917); fit-complaint
Frequency: Per employee (onboarding) + per vendor fit
Volume: ~1,200–1,600 new hires/yr × sizing + ongoing fit adjustments
Owner: Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Manager / HR Shared Services (VS-103)
Participants: HR (VS-19/VS-121), Supplier (W4917), Store Ops (VS-07), Privacy/DPO (VS-91)
Source: workflow W4918 — Sizing, Fit &amp; Body-Measurement Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4918_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4918_Lane1" name="Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4918_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4918_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4918_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
