    <bpmn:process id="W_W4919" name="W4919. Branded Apparel Design, Procurement &amp; Quality" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Brand refresh (VS-14); season/format; wear-rate issue; supplier change (W4917)
Frequency: Per design refresh + procurement cycle
Volume: ~15–20 garment types × annual design refresh × ~6,932 employees + buffer
Owner: Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Manager / Brand / Procurement
Participants: Brand/Marketing (VS-14), Procurement (VS-03/VS-34), Supplier (W4917), Quality (VS-31), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W4919 — Branded Apparel Design, Procurement &amp; Quality</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4919_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4919_Lane1" name="Brand">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4919_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4919_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
