        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4919_Lane3" name="Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4919_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4919_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4919_Start5" name="Brand refresh (VS-14); season/format; wear-rate issue; supplier change (W4917)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4919_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4919_Task6" name="Design the branded apparel per brand guidelines (VS-14) and the role-based…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Design the branded apparel per brand guidelines (VS-14) and the role-based standard (W4914): garment specs, fabric/durability (tropical-climate, high-wash-frequency, stain-resistance for paint/yard), branding/logo/embroidery, color, and PPE-compatibility (hi-vis over branded, smock compatibility)
Responsible (R): Brand / Program Manager / Supplier / HSE
Accountable (A): VP Marketing / CHRO
Duration: Per refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4919_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4919_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4919_Task7" name="Procure &amp; manage quality: place frame-agreement call-offs (W4917)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Procure &amp; manage quality: place frame-agreement call-offs (W4917), quality-inspect on receipt (VS-31 — stitching, color-fastness, sizing accuracy, PPE-cert verification W4915), manage defects/returns, and maintain buffer stock (W4932)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Quality / Program Manager
Accountable (A): Program Manager
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4919_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4919_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4919_Task8" name="Iterate on wear-rate &amp; feedback: track garment wear-life/failure modes (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Iterate on wear-rate &amp; feedback: track garment wear-life/failure modes (links W4930/W4933), feed to design improvement, and refresh designs on the brand/season cycle; manage the branded-apparel IP/trademark (links VS-100.2)
Responsible (R): Program Manager / Brand / Quality / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4919_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4919_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4919_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4919_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4919_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-737 (ensure controlled execution — Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Strategy, Policy &amp; Sourcing (PA-169.1).) | - CTL-737: brand-guideline design; durability spec; quality-inspected on receipt; PPE-compatibility verified
Owner: Uniform &amp; Workwear Program Manager / Brand / Procurement</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
